1
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:21,860
Steps for labeling a map.

2
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,640
For labeling a map, you should take 
 the following

3
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:25,300
 steps.

4
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,860
Firstly, look at the map to identify fixed

5
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:29,520
locations.

6
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:33,140
Next, we need to identify the direction and

7
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:35,580
describe the position of locations we need to

8
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:36,680
label on the map.

9
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:39,700
If the question's requirement is to fill in

10
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:41,620
words on a map, then you should pay

11
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:43,080
attention to the word limit.

12
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,940
In step 3, you have to listen and

13
00:00:45,940 --> 00:00:48,200
fill in the correct answers in each blank.

14
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:51,760
In case you get lost, take notes immediately

15
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:53,200
and do not panic.

16
00:00:53,740 --> 00:00:56,460
Finally, you have to check your answers after listening.

17
00:00:57,460 --> 00:00:59,580
You will not lose points if you write

18
00:00:59,580 --> 00:01:02,520
the incorrect answers, so never leave your answer

19
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:03,180
sheet blank.

20
00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:05,460
Let's look at an example together.

21
00:01:05,460 --> 00:01:09,940
In this example, the question requires you to

22
00:01:09,940 --> 00:01:12,760
find the position of five locations on the

23
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:14,720
map and write the correct letter.

24
00:01:15,620 --> 00:01:16,740
A to I.

25
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:19,500
Here are the steps for this type of

26
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:19,980
exercise.

27
00:01:20,940 --> 00:01:21,580
Step 1.

28
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,760
Identify fixed locations.

29
00:01:25,260 --> 00:01:27,840
Here, we can immediately see that the main

30
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:29,980
building is near the middle of the map

31
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:32,600
with an emergency exit on the right side.

32
00:01:33,380 --> 00:01:35,320
When we get out of the main building,

33
00:01:35,580 --> 00:01:37,360
we will be on the main road.

34
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,900
When we get out of the main building

35
00:01:40,900 --> 00:01:43,880
and turn right, we will reach Anita Road.

36
00:01:45,660 --> 00:01:49,580
Near the locations A, E and F, there

37
00:01:49,580 --> 00:01:51,800
are some trees and there is a back

38
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:53,760
gate on the right border of the map.

39
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:55,420
Step 2.

40
00:01:55,660 --> 00:01:56,980
Identify the direction.

41
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:59,520
In step 2, we have to identify the

42
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:02,720
direction and describe the position of locations from

43
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:04,560
A to I on the map.

44
00:02:05,180 --> 00:02:08,520
In this exercise, the starting point may be

45
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:09,960
the main building.

46
00:02:10,780 --> 00:02:13,660
To describe location G, you may hear the

47
00:02:13,660 --> 00:02:15,540
following instruction in the recording.

48
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:19,580
You get out of the main building, turn

49
00:02:19,580 --> 00:02:21,800
right and G is on the left side.

50
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:25,560
To reach location C, you may hear the following 

51
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,360
sentence.

52
00:02:27,420 --> 00:02:30,100
You go out of the emergency exit, C

53
00:02:30,100 --> 00:02:31,200
is on your right.

54
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:35,220
In the listening test, you will not have

55
00:02:35,220 --> 00:02:37,060
a lot of time for this step before

56
00:02:37,060 --> 00:02:39,840
the recording starts, so it's important that you

57
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:42,060
practice making these predictions fast.

58
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:45,240
In step 3, you have to listen to the 

59
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:47,320
recording and fill in the correct answers.

60
00:02:48,180 --> 00:02:51,500
When you get lost, remember to take notes

61
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:52,300
immediately.

62
00:02:53,300 --> 00:02:55,900
And step 4, after listening, you have to check 

63
00:02:55,900 --> 00:02:57,940
your answers and never leave your answer

64
00:02:57,940 --> 00:02:58,680
sheet blank.

65
00:02:59,100 --> 00:03:01,440
Next, you will listen to the recording and

66
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:03,780
complete this map in the practice section.

67
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:04,740
See you soon!

